# node_modules must never be copied in: a macOS-native better-sqlite3 would
# overwrite the one built for the image and fail to load.
**/node_modules
**/dev-data
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
*.md
!cartridge_player/README.md
!cartridge_player/CHANGELOG.md

# NOTE: **/dist is deliberately NOT ignored. The image copies prebuilt output
# rather than compiling inside an emulated ARM container, which used to hang.
